    "detailed_description": "<h1>DON'T FORGET TO WHISTLIST!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1753725897\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1753725897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1753725897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ride Through the City</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/11bd6be2e501b2abcebed6e87932e355.poster.avif?t=1753725897\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/11bd6be2e501b2abcebed6e87932e355.webm?t=1753725897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/11bd6be2e501b2abcebed6e87932e355.mp4?t=1753725897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your cart and ride through the bustling streets, find the best location to sell your hotdogs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy Sources &amp; Ingredients</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/8465f2040b0796abd9a21ff30eb4fed9.poster.avif?t=1753725897\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/8465f2040b0796abd9a21ff30eb4fed9.webm?t=1753725897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/8465f2040b0796abd9a21ff30eb4fed9.mp4?t=1753725897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock up on a variety of sources and fresh ingredients to create mouthwatering hotdogs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare Delicious Hotdogs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/25def20f272081f6606d0a217374a66a.poster.avif?t=1753725897\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/25def20f272081f6606d0a217374a66a.webm?t=1753725897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/25def20f272081f6606d0a217374a66a.mp4?t=1753725897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of delicious sauces and toppings, then serve up your tasty creations to hungry customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make a Profit!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/d9f95fff2362fe94661a73ad73498e99.poster.avif?t=1753725897\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/d9f95fff2362fe94661a73ad73498e99.webm?t=1753725897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/d9f95fff2362fe94661a73ad73498e99.mp4?t=1753725897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your prices, manage your stock, and grow your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Cart!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/91489902847773b48cfbffb6fec8b14a.poster.avif?t=1753725897\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/91489902847773b48cfbffb6fec8b14a.webm?t=1753725897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/91489902847773b48cfbffb6fec8b14a.mp4?t=1753725897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your cart with new designs, cool add-ons, and fancy accessories. Make it stand out and attract more hungry customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the City!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/a391d6a034b57f63abcf908ab06976e0.poster.avif?t=1753725897\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/a391d6a034b57f63abcf908ab06976e0.webm?t=1753725897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/a391d6a034b57f63abcf908ab06976e0.mp4?t=1753725897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>From sunny beaches to busy downtown streets. Discover every corner of the city!</p>",
